        <item>Hi! I\'m Ferrdroid. With R4A you code Rust on your phone, no PC needed.</item>
        <item>Tap New project to start, or open your own folder with 📁.</item>
        <item>Inside is the editor. Tap ▶ and your program runs right here.</item>
        <item>Something broke? Problems shows the error, Console shows the output.</item>
        <item>Games? Pick the macroquad template, try it with ▶ and export an APK.</item>
        <item>Don\'t know Rust? No worries! Add an AI key in Settings, tap AI and build anything.</item>
        <item>Each project\'s AI helps you code. Done! Find me again in Settings.</item>
